# Nothing here is required. The app runs with zero configuration — a local
# SQLite database is created automatically on first run, and Apify/Anthropic
# keys are entered in Settings → API Keys once the server is up.
#
# These two are only useful if you'd rather set a default key via environment
# variable than paste it into Settings (e.g. sharing this on a machine where
# you don't want the key saved to disk). A key saved in Settings always wins
# over these. Copy this file to .env.local if you want to use them.

APIFY_API_TOKEN=""
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=""
